{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["DIGIMON ADVENTURE 20th memorial story","A series of prequel anime shorts that will tell side stories not shown in Digimon Adventure: Last Evolution Kizuna.\n\n\n\nOver ten years have passed since that initial adventure. Sora worries over what she should do with her future. What choice has she ultimately arrived at?\n\n\n\n(Source: Toei Animation)"],"ja":["デジモンアドベンチャー20th メモリアルストーリー",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[{"id":38088,"relation":"sequel"},{"id":36466,"relation":"prequel"}],"id":"mal-41206","ids":{"shikimori":41206,"mal":41206,"anilist":115107,"kodik":"serial-79116"},"kodikIds":["serial-36272","serial-79116"],"kodikRevisions":{"serial-36272":"2021-08-02T06:57:48Z","serial-79116":"2026-10-17T14:56:24Z"},"title":"Приключения Дигимонов: Рассказ о двадцатилетнем юбилее","originalTitle":"Digimon Adventure: 20 Shuunen Memorial Story","alt":"DIGIMON ADVENTURE 20th memorial story デジモンアドベンチャー20th メモリアルストーリー","description":"Началась краудфандинговая кампания для проекта \"Мемориальная история приключений Дигимона\". Это были 5 короткометражек, которые включали приквел к предстоящему фильму и дополнительные истории о повседневной жизни персонажей-дигимонов и их партнеров, которые не вошли в фильм. Кампания была успешно поддержана.","year":2020,"type":"ONA","genres":["Приключения","Драма"],"rating":6.75,"popularity":2977,"ongoing":false,"relatedMalIds":[38088,36466],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/uploads/poster/animes/41206/0c5a8828ca6260284328e191e9c9c124.jpeg","width":425,"height":600},"backdrop":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/system/screenshots/original/943761854f1ea936f7a8bebe6c035189d71f2b73.jpg","width":1280,"height":720}},"releasedEpisodes":[1,2,3,4,5],"episodes":[{"number":1,"ordinal":1,"season":1,"audio":[{"id":"kodik-1500","dubId":"1500","label":"YakuSub Studio.Subtitles","language":"ja","original":true,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"prov